                                        "entry_id": "dcb8e699-5ab6-356c-9510-a7b2e6a3fec7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A protein, similar to collagen, found in connective tissue, that has elastic properties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b38ecbe8-4771-446b-8776-6d377aba892c",
                                                "sense_id": "7387f357-9e22-387b-b561-0e4d036a1cf3",
                                                "text": "Our stomachs produce an enzyme specifically designed to break down elastin, a type of protein found in meat and nowhere else."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
